-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Test data (not part of any built binary or installer)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

testdata/msg/poi/ contains unmodified sample files from the Apache POI test corpus
(https://github.com/apache/poi/tree/trunk/test-data, hsmf/ and hmef/), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0. Apache POI's NOTICE reads, in relevant part:

    Apache POI
    Copyright 2003-2026 The Apache Software Foundation

    This product includes software developed at
    The Apache Software Foundation (https://www.apache.org/).

All other files under testdata/ were written for this project and are covered by the
project license; see testdata/README.md.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party dependencies
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Binaries link Rust crates (see Cargo.lock) and the desktop app bundles JavaScript
packages (see app/package-lock.json), each under its own license. All are permissive
(MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, ISC, Zlib, Unicode-3.0, BSL-1.0, CC0) or file-level copyleft
(MPL-2.0, unmodified); the allow-list is enforced by `cargo deny check licenses`
(deny.toml).

The binaries include the IANA time zone database (public domain, via the jiff-tzdb
crate), and crates/mbox/src/tzid.rs contains a Windows-to-IANA time zone table derived
from the Unicode CLDR `windowsZones` data (Unicode License v3).
